            "value" : "1 Buch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Radio tab, colorful mixes, and shuffle, repeat and the heart show when they're on. A song that drops out goes on where it stopped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Radio-Tab, bunte Mixe, und Zufall, Wiederholen und das Herz zeigen, ob sie an sind. Bricht ein Song ab, geht er an derselben Stelle weiter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add another account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weiteres Konto hinzufügen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to the Jukebox" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zur Jukebox hinzugefügt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At home and on the go" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zu Hause und unterwegs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At home Tonalo uses the home address, everywhere else the server address. For Cloudflare Zero Trust, add a service token under Custom headers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zu Hause nutzt Tonalo die Adresse im Heimnetz, sonst überall die Serveradresse. Für Cloudflare Zero Trust trägst du unter „Eigene Header“ ein Service-Token ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At the end of the chapter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Am Ende des Kapitels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
