    "Yellow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gelb"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your music, playlists and downloads on the car screen, with a heart for your favorites." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Musik, Playlists und Downloads auf dem Bildschirm im Auto, mit Herz für deine Lieblingssongs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your radio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Radio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re offline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist offline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re on mobile data. Downloads start as soon as you’re on Wi-Fi, or right away if you allow cellular." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist im Mobilfunknetz. Die Downloads starten, sobald du im WLAN bist – oder sofort, wenn du Mobilfunk erlaubst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your downloads still work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Downloads funktionieren trotzdem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your favorite songs, shuffled" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Lieblingssongs, gemischt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Jukebox" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Jukebox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Library" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bibliothek"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your most played" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine meistgehörten Songs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your music, from your own server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Musik, von deinem eigenen Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your playlists" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Playlists"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your server doesn’t allow this change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Server erlaubt diese Änderung nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your PC" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "deinem PC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "your TV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "deinem TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audiobooks on the TV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hörbücher am TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book playing on your TV or computer shows up here, and you control it from the phone. Play on moves it over, from the same spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Hörbuch, das auf deinem TV oder Computer läuft, erscheint hier, und du steuerst es vom iPhone aus. „Spielen auf“ bringt es an derselben Stelle hinüber."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Better on the watch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Besser auf der Uhr"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Play and pause on the watch no longer stop the phone by mistake, covers show up, and skipping on the phone shows on the watch too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Play und Pause auf der Uhr stoppen das iPhone nicht mehr aus Versehen, Cover werden angezeigt, und Vorspulen am iPhone zeigt sich auch auf der Uhr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection to TV and computer" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verbindung zu TV und Computer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone follows your TV and your computer at once and shows the one that is playing, also when the app is opened several times in a row." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das iPhone folgt deinem TV und deinem Computer gleichzeitig und zeigt das, auf dem gerade etwas läuft, auch wenn die App mehrmals schnell hintereinander geöffnet wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steadier connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stabilere Verbindung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone finds your TV or computer more reliably after the app opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das iPhone findet deinen TV oder Computer nach dem Öffnen der App zuverlässiger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV connection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV-Verbindung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Songs the TV can't play are converted, a switched-off TV is let go of sooner, and it's found again by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lieder, die der TV nicht abspielt, werden umgewandelt, ein ausgeschalteter TV wird schneller losgelassen und von selbst wiedergefunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting over" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Von vorn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A song you stopped long ago starts from the beginning. Audiobooks still continue where you were." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Lied, das du vor langer Zeit gestoppt hast, startet von vorn. Hörbücher machen weiter, wo du warst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ didn't start the audiobook – playing here again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ hat das Hörbuch nicht gestartet – es läuft wieder hier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now playing, at a glance" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf einen Blick: das läuft gerade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The song that plays right now moves with small bars, on the Home tiles and in every playlist, album and search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Song, der gerade läuft, bewegt sich mit kleinen Balken: auf den Kacheln der Startseite und in jeder Playlist, jedem Album und der Suche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DJ for your TV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DJ für deinen Fernseher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the DJ while your TV plays and its queue is replaced, so you hear the new set next. The DJ also has its own entry in your profile menu, and its tile on Home moves while it plays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tippe auf den DJ, während dein Fernseher spielt, und seine Warteschlange wird ersetzt, du hörst also gleich das neue Set. Der DJ hat außerdem einen eigenen Eintrag im Profilmenü, und seine Kachel auf der Startseite bewegt sich, solange er spielt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pull to refresh everywhere" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Überall nach unten ziehen zum Aktualisieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audiobooks and podcasts refresh now too, and the doubled spinner is gone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hörbücher und Podcasts lassen sich jetzt auch aktualisieren, und der doppelte Kreis ist weg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Several accounts on one TV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mehrere Konten an einem Fernseher"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each profile pairs on its own, and the DJ goes to the TV with the right account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes Profil koppelt für sich, und der DJ geht an den Fernseher mit dem richtigen Konto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jukebox hearts" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Herzen in der Jukebox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Songs from a guest show your own hearts, and the heart on CarPlay now switches the right song." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Songs von Gästen zeigen deine eigenen Herzen, und das Herz in CarPlay schaltet jetzt den richtigen Song um."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a song in the queue and drag it up or down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte in der Warteschlange einen Song gedrückt und zieh ihn nach oben oder unten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wish, e.g. calm for the evening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein Wunsch, z. B. ruhig für den Abend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API-Schlüssel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Address, e.g. 192.168.1.20:11434" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adresse, z. B. 192.168.1.20:11434"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agree and turn on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zustimmen und einschalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An AI model of your choice picks sets from your own library and puts them in order. It never talks. Off until you turn it on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein KI-Modell deiner Wahl stellt Sets aus deiner eigenen Bibliothek zusammen und bringt sie in eine Reihenfolge. Es spricht nie. Aus, bis du es einschaltest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ändern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auswählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DJ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DJ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schlüssel löschen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For every set, Tonalo sends title, artist, album, genre, year and the favorite mark of about 150 of your songs, which songs the DJ played last, and your wish, directly from this iPhone to %@. What happens to it there follows that provider's terms. Tonalo itself receives nothing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für jedes Set sendet Tonalo Titel, Künstler, Album, Genre, Jahr und Favoriten-Markierung von rund 150 deiner Songs, welche Songs der DJ zuletzt gespielt hat, und deinen Wunsch direkt von diesem iPhone an %@. Was dort damit geschieht, richtet sich nach den Bedingungen dieses Anbieters. Tonalo selbst erhält nichts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Larger models choose better and cost more per set." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Größere Modelle wählen besser aus und kosten pro Set mehr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Load models" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Modelle laden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
